her Gargoyles still watch over our city and punish the guilty.\" —Gulsen, Abbey Matron</em>"}]},{"productId":158462,"name":"Armageddon - 1996 Bertrand Lestree (4ED)","cleanName":"Armageddon 1996 Bertrand Lestree 4ED","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/158462_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2198,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/158462/magic-world-championship-decks-armageddon-1996-bertrand-lestree-4ed","modifiedOn":"2018-02-09T15:42:37.133","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"S"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Sorcery"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Destroy all lands.\r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>Not a Tournament Legal card.</strong>"}]},{"productId":158463,"name":"Autumn Willow - 1996 Bertrand Lestree (HML)","cleanName":"Autumn Willow 1996 Bertrand Lestree HML","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/158463_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2198,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/158463/magic-world-championship-decks-autumn-willow-1996-bertrand-lestree-hml","modifiedOn":"2018-02-09T15:42:40.637","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"S"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Legend"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"4"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"4"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Cannot be the target of spells or effects.\r\n<br>G: Target player may target Autumn Willow with spells or effects until end of turn."},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"We must shake her limbs and rattle her brains.\" —Grandmother Sengir</em>"}]},{"productId":158464,"name":"Balance - 1996 Bertrand Lestree (4ED)","cleanName":"Balance 1996 Bertran