ttps://www.tcgplayer.com/product/162776/magic-world-championship-decks-2004-aeo-paquette-decklist-card","modifiedOn":"2018-03-21T13:11:29.62","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"S"}]},{"productId":162777,"name":"2004 World Championship Advertisement Card","cleanName":"2004 World Championship Advertisement Card","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/162777_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2198,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/162777/magic-world-championship-decks-2004-world-championship-advertisement-card","modifiedOn":"2019-10-04T19:11:25.847","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"S"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Collect All Four World Championship Decks</strong>\r\n<br>Relive the excitement of the 2004 World Championships with these four commemorative decks.\r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>Julien Nuijten, World Champion</strong>\r\n<br>At just fifteen years old, Julien Nuijten is the youngest ever <strong>Magic: The Gathering</strong>® World Champion. He came out of nowhere to stun the field with a green-white Astral Slide deck that gains tremendous card advantage from Eternal Witness.\r\n<br><strong>Aeo Paquette, Finalist</strong>\r\n<br>Professional <strong>Magic</strong>® player Aeo Paquette played the deck that defined the metagame at the 2004 World Championships. With more than forty artifacts, his \"Affinity\" deck uses the power of Arcbound Ravager and Disciple of the Vault to race to victory.\r\n<br><strong>Manuel Bevand, Semifinalist</strong>\r\n<br>Pro Tour™ veteran Manuel Bevand's artifact-based combo deck uses Krark-Clan Ironworks to quickly get a Myr Incubator into play, which then creates thirty or more 1/1 Myr creatures—somtimes as early as the third turn!\r\n<br><strong>Gabriel Nassif, Semifinalist</strong>\r\n<br>Gabriel Nassif's performance at Worlds earned the Parisian the coveted 2004 Player of the Year award. Designed to beat the ubiquitous \"Affinity\" decks, his counter-heavy blue-white control deck performed well against the entire field."}]},{"productId":162778,"name":"2004 World Championship Blank Card","cleanName":"2004 World Championship Blank Card","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/162778_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2198,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/162778/magic-world-championship-decks-2004-world-championship-blank-card","modifiedOn":"2023-09-27T20:11:16.733","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"S"}]},{"productId":162779,"name":"Annul - 2004 Aeo Paquette (MRD) (SB)","cleanName":"Annul 2004 Aeo Paquette MRD SB","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/162779_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2198,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/162779/magic-world-championship-decks-annul-2004-aeo-paquette-mrd-sb","modifiedOn":"2023-03-10T20:59:15.607","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"S"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Instant"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Counter target artifact or enchantment spell.\r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>Not a Tournament Legal card.</strong>\r\n<br><em>”SB” indicates this is a sideboard card.</em>"},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"Murder of the living is tragic, but murder of the idea is unforgivable.\" —Janus, speaker of the synod</em>"}]},{"productId":162780,"name":"Arcbound Ravager - 2004 Aeo Paquette (DST)","cleanName":"Arcbound Ravager 2004 Aeo Paquette DST","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/162780_200w.jpg","categor